# How to cite the conjecture-search template itself. A program instantiated from it
# replaces this file with templates/CITATION.cff, filled in for its search.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this template, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Conjecture search template"
abstract: >-
  A MyST manuscript together with a harness for sustained conjecture search: proving or
  refuting one hard statement over many sessions and several AI agents, with every status
  certified by an independent review or a named human.
authors:
  - family-names: Brosse
    given-names: Nicolas
    affiliation: "CREST, ENSAE Paris, Institut Polytechnique de Paris"
repository-code: "https://github.com/human-ai-mathematics/conjecture-search-template"
url: "https://human-ai-mathematics.github.io/conjecture-search/proposal.html"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - mathematics
  - conjecture
  - AI agents
  - certified proofs
  - MyST
